# Local-only artifacts
update.log
# logrotate suffixes. `update.log` does NOT match `update.log.1` or
# `update.log.2.gz`, so six rotated logs sat tracked in this PUBLIC repo,
# churning on every 5-minute run and leaving `git status` permanently dirty.
# Same hole was found in fraqtoos-chat on 2026-08-23. Whenever a logrotate
# config is added, re-check the matching ignore rule — rotation renames files
# straight out from under a bare-name pattern.
update.log.*
tunnel_health.log
tunnel_health.log.*
btc_update.log
btc_futures_update.log
agentdb.rvf
agentdb.rvf.lock
